Error [jet.CryptoExpertNotAllowed]: `core.crypto.expert.argon2id` requires an audited `#Unsafe` region
  --> tests/ui/crypto_argon2id_literal_policy_e0510_precedence.jet:9:17
    |
  9 |     _ :: expert.argon2id(password, [0], 8191, 0, 0, 15)
    |                 ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Raw crypto primitives may only run inside an explicit expert-tier gate (I1)
 Fix: Wrap the call in `#Unsafe("crypto expert: …") { … }` or use `crypto.seal`/`open` instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0510
